"石井","creatorId":"vndb:s26763","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26763","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26763","name":"石井","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:110167","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"スタジオポッド","creatorId":"vndb:s19061","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19061","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19061","name":"株式会社スタジオポッド","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:110168","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17848","characterName":"陽ノ下 心春","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17848"},"originalCharacterName":"陽ノ下 心春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the girlfriend of the main character, Arata. She is popular for her cute face with a hint of childishness and her calm and gentle personality, she is also good at housework in general, and her classmates call her “the ideal wife” because of her devotion to her boyfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She calls her boyfriend Shin “Akkun,” and although they are unaware of it, they flirt whenever they get a chance, and are treated as a couple. They are not good at talking about sex, but they are very interested in it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She knows that Arata cares about her, but she is a little insecure about her attractiveness as a woman because he does not ask her for her body very often."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17848"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98685327360c9a54c373191dcfd3447d97ffd5c1637d855c5bc2e2cb0402b29c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bdb75a1520c5134fc79143f050914d81993813ab8819cd96d862348eb4a34e58.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ヒマリ","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58929","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17849","characterName":"朝岡 源蔵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17849"},"originalCharacterName":"朝岡 源蔵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Father of the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a lot of experience with women and is used to dealing with them. He is the president of a major real estate company, and has made a lot of money through land speculation and other nefarious methods."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has the idea that he can get what he wants by any means necessary, and he has used various methods to win the women he likes for himself. He has also taken possession of Arata's mother by sleeping with her from a man she was dating at the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17849"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86e9e6235f7b27d286ce3c4378ab9ab878bd5af25a92068c9e157dee92c6fe0d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16df8171a6f570bc85d9aae695a2e8482a2cbff94a56a54e573f224976f86964.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17850","characterName":"朝岡 勝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17850"},"originalCharacterName":"朝岡 勝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The elder brother of the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He does not have a regular job. He is selfish, arrogant, womanizing, and a bad influence on women. He is a smooth talker and is good at getting into people's minds, so he is popular with women, but he is sloppy and has relationships with several women for fun."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the opposite of Arata and dislikes him. He also has very similar tastes to his father and can't help but make a move on the woman of his choice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has liked Koharu since the first time he saw her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17850"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32e6a09489db2e2a7c36930ba59ddf220a40339b3465f8795ee0240c65433bc7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0fba1c143f1e6c25129c44dad7ba116f767a014277ae555d43b830ef9a63a8a1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20020","characterName":"朝岡 新","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20020"},"originalCharacterName":"朝岡 新","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the main character of this work and is dating Koharu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the son of Genzou and a woman who was his mistress. Because of his birth, he is very fastidious."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since he was treated as a nuisance in the house since childhood, he has a strong desire to be needed by someone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has seen his father and brother's bad behavior, so he has a policy of “I will never betray a girl I like or make her sad! Therefore, he cares about the heroine very much."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20020"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d99f2f152481e78fd963f5276048568f70b8e386890a1bcedd96db503ade8b73.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/547a04cd8895a98bb3ac59a0046114b74d10a230aa8f3413eb03d8f20f9bbb83.webp","width":137,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p684","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1841","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p684","name":"pin-point","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:27929:1841","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p20696","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p20696","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p20696","name":"WildNoiR","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:127968:v15167","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p17073","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p17073","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p17073","name":"Pandemic Team","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:136792:v15167","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p684","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p684","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p684","name":"ピンポイント","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:39035:v15167","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p684","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p684","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p684","name":"ピンポイント","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:39036:v15167","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p684","sourceCompanyId"